---
layout: base.njk
title: "Zunkiree Labs: Innovative AI Solutions for Business Success" # SEOAI:TITLE
description: "AI-powered products built in Nepal: Zunkiree Search for AI-native search, Gaamma manufacturing ERP, AI CRM, AI Booking Engine. Enterprise software from Kathmandu."
permalink: /products/
hideChrome: true
bodyClass: "v2-inter"
schemaType: SoftwareApplication

# Hero section
heroLabel: Products
heroTitle: Products
heroTagline: "Software built for the problem, not the pitch deck."

# Intro section
introHeadline: "Products that work. From day one."
introDescription: "Most AI products are built for demos, then configured forever. Ours ship ready — each one started as a solution built for a real customer, hardened in production, then made available to everyone. Six products built in Nepal, deployable anywhere."

# AEO definition block
definitionBlock:
  question: "What software products does Zunkiree Labs make?"
  answer: "Zunkiree Labs builds AI-powered software products for search, commerce, bookings, CRM, and manufacturing — plus a dedicated AI assistant for dental practices. Each product is built and maintained by a specialist team in Kathmandu, Nepal, and designed for deployment within days, not months."

# Category tabs for filtering
catalogCategories:
  - id: ai
    label: AI Products
  - id: business
    label: Business Tools
  - id: enterprise
    label: Enterprise Software

# CTA section
ctaHeadline: "Every product fits differently. Let's find yours."
ctaDescription: "Tell us what you're trying to automate. We'll match you to the right product — or say so if nothing fits."
ctaButtonText: Book a Product Demo
ctaButtonUrl: /contact/
---

{# =====================================================
   PRODUCTS CATALOG — Website V2
   Restyled onto the homepage-v2 / product-app.njk visual system:
   Inter type, navy-950 + #76B900 accent, mono uppercase labels,
   console-frame cards, sliding-pill tabs. Content, filtering
   behavior, and copy preserved verbatim from the prior catalog.njk
   render — this is a UI/UX refactor only, not a content rewrite.
   ===================================================== #}

{% include "partials/navbar-v2.njk" %}

<script>
  document.documentElement.classList.add('js-reveal-hidden');
</script>
<style>
  .js-reveal-hidden [data-reveal]:not(.revealed),
  .js-reveal-hidden [data-reveal-stagger]:not(.revealed) > * {
    opacity: 0;
  }
</style>

{# =====================================================
   HERO — same centered/mono-eyebrow grammar as homepage-v2 and
   product-app.njk, light background instead of catalog.njk's
   dark navy split-image hero.
   ===================================================== #}
<section class="relative px-4 pb-8 pt-32 sm:px-6 sm:pt-36 lg:px-8 lg:pt-40" aria-labelledby="products-hero-heading">
  <div class="relative z-10 mx-auto max-w-3xl" data-reveal-stagger>
    <div class="flex flex-col items-center text-center">
      <span class="mb-4 inline-flex items-center rounded-full border border-sky-100/60 bg-sky-50/60 px-3.5 py-1.5 font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-wider text-sky-600 shadow-subtle">
        {{ heroLabel }}
      </span>

      <h1 id="products-hero-heading" class="text-center text-balance text-[38px] font-medium leading-[1.15] tracking-tight text-[#111827] sm:text-[48px] sm:leading-[1.1] lg:text-[57px]">
        {{ heroTitle }}
      </h1>

      <p class="mt-4 max-w-[560px] px-4 text-center text-balance text-[20px] font-medium leading-relaxed text-[#6B7280] sm:text-[22px]">
        {{ heroTagline }}
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{# =====================================================
   INTRO — deliberately asymmetric, left-aligned two-column block
   (same eyebrow + h2 grammar as homepage-v2's "Resources" section)
   instead of a second centered headline stacked under the hero.
   The AEO definition block that existed in frontmatter but was
   never rendered by the old catalog.njk layout now has its own
   card alongside the intro copy, content unchanged.
   ===================================================== #}
<section class="px-4 pb-14 pt-6 sm:px-6 sm:pb-20 lg:px-8" aria-labelledby="products-intro-heading" data-reveal>
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-5xl">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 items-start gap-10 lg:grid-cols-[1.15fr_1fr] lg:gap-14">
      <div>
        <span class="mb-4 block font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-wider text-[#9CA3AF]">Overview</span>
        <h2 id="products-intro-heading" class="max-w-md text-[28px] font-semibold leading-[1.2] text-[#111827] sm:text-[32px]">
          {{ introHeadline }}
        </h2>
        {% if introDescription %}
        <p class="mt-4 max-w-lg text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-[#6B7280] sm:text-[16px]">
          {{ introDescription }}
        </p>
        {% endif %}
      </div>

      {% if definitionBlock %}
      <div class="relative overflow-hidden rounded-lg border border-sky-100 bg-sky-50/70 p-7 sm:p-8">
        <div
          class="pointer-events-none absolute -right-10 -top-10 h-32 w-32 rounded-full"
          aria-hidden="true"
          style="background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(61,143,212,0.16) 0%, transparent 70%);"
        ></div>

        <span class="relative z-10 mb-4 flex h-9 w-9 flex-shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-navy-950 text-sky-300" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg class="h-4 w-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/>
            <path d="M9.5 9.2a2.5 2.5 0 0 1 4.9.8c0 1.7-2.4 2-2.4 3.5"/>
            <circle cx="12" cy="16.7" r="0.4" fill="currentColor" stroke="none"/>
          </svg>
        </span>

        <p class="relative z-10 font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-wider text-sky-700">{{ definitionBlock.question }}</p>
        <p class="relative z-10 mt-3 text-[14px] leading-relaxed text-[#374151] sm:text-[15px]">{{ definitionBlock.answer }}</p>
      </div>
      {% endif %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{# =====================================================
   CATALOG — sliding-pill category tabs (same grammar as
   product-app.njk's use-case tabs) over a console-frame product
   grid. Filtering behavior (Alpine x-show by category) preserved
   from the original catalog.njk.
   ===================================================== #}
<section
  class="px-4 py-12 sm:px-6 sm:py-16 lg:px-8"
  aria-labelledby="products-catalog-heading"
  x-data="{
    activeTab: 'all',
    pillLeft: 0,
    pillWidth: 0,
    updatePill() {
      const el = this.$refs['catalogTab' + this.activeTab];
      if (el) { this.pillLeft = el.offsetLeft; this.pillWidth = el.offsetWidth; }
    }
  }"
  x-init="$nextTick(() => updatePill())"
  @resize.window="updatePill()"
>
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-5xl">
    <h2 id="products-catalog-heading" class="sr-only">All products</h2>

    {% if catalogCategories.length > 0 %}
    <div class="mb-10 flex justify-center overflow-x-auto" data-reveal>
      <div role="tablist" aria-label="Product categories" class="relative inline-flex flex-shrink-0 items-center gap-1 rounded-full border border-sky-200/70 bg-sky-50 p-1 shadow-subtle">
        <span
          class="absolute inset-y-1 rounded-full bg-white shadow-md transition-all duration-300 ease-out"
          :style="`left: ${pillLeft}px; width: ${pillWidth}px;`"
          aria-hidden="true"
        ></span>
        <button
          type="button"
          role="tab"
          :aria-selected="activeTab === 'all' ? 'true' : 'false'"
          @click="activeTab = 'all'; updatePill()"
          x-ref="catalogTaball"
          class="relative z-10 flex flex-shrink-0 items-center gap-2 whitespace-nowrap rounded-full px-4 py-2.5 font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-wide transition-colors duration-200 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-[#76B900] focus-visible:ring-offset-2"
          :class="activeTab === 'all' ? 'text-navy-900' : 'text-sky-700 hover:text-navy-800'"
        >
          <span class="h-1.5 w-1.5 flex-shrink-0 rounded-full transition-colors duration-200" :class="activeTab === 'all' ? 'bg-[#76B900]' : 'bg-sky-300'" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          All Products
        </button>
        {% for category in catalogCategories %}
        <button
          type="button"
          role="tab"
          :aria-selected="activeTab === '{{ category.id }}' ? 'true' : 'false'"
          @click="activeTab = '{{ category.id }}'; updatePill()"
          x-ref="catalogTab{{ category.id }}"
          class="relative z-10 flex flex-shrink-0 items-center gap-2 whitespace-nowrap rounded-full px-4 py-2.5 font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-wide transition-colors duration-200 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-[#76B900] focus-visible:ring-offset-2"
          :class="activeTab === '{{ category.id }}' ? 'text-navy-900' : 'text-sky-700 hover:text-navy-800'"
        >
          <span class="h-1.5 w-1.5 flex-shrink-0 rounded-full transition-colors duration-200" :class="activeTab === '{{ category.id }}' ? 'bg-[#76B900]' : 'bg-sky-300'" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          {{ category.label }}
        </button>
        {% endfor %}
      </div>
    </div>
    {% endif %}

    {# Product grid — quiet white cards on the pale panel, a thin
       accent bar carrying the heading/body block, and a bordered
       pill CTA below a divider (Kore.ai "AI for Service" grid
       composition, rebuilt in our own navy/#76B900/mono tokens) #}
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-6 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3" data-reveal-stagger>
      {% for item in products %}
        <article
          class="group relative flex flex-col rounded-lg border border-navy-100 bg-gradient-to-b from-sky-50/50 to-white p-7 shadow-subtle transition-shadow duration-300 hover:shadow-card sm:p-8"
          {% if catalogCategories.length > 0 %}
          x-show="activeTab === 'all'{% for category in catalogCategories %} || (activeTab === '{{ category.id }}' && '{{ item.category }}' === '{{ category.label }}'){% endfor %}"
          x-transition:enter="transition ease-out duration-200"
          x-transition:enter-start="opacity-0"
          x-transition:enter-end="opacity-100"
          {% endif %}
        >
          {# Eyebrow — product name + live/coming-soon status, text only #}
          <div class="mb-5 flex items-center justify-between gap-3">
            <span class="truncate font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-wider text-sky-600">{{ item.title }}</span>
            {% if item.status == "Coming Soon" %}
              <span class="flex-shrink-0 font-mono text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-amber-600">Coming Soon</span>
            {% else %}
              <span class="flex-shrink-0 font-mono text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-[#5a9100]">Live</span>
            {% endif %}
          </div>

          {# Heading + body, carried by a thin brand-accent bar #}
          <div class="flex flex-1 gap-5">
            <span class="w-[2px] flex-shrink-0 self-stretch rounded-full bg-[#76B900]/60" aria-hidden="true"></span>
            <div class="flex flex-1 flex-col">
              <h3 class="text-[19px] font-semibold leading-snug text-[#111827] sm:text-[20px]">{{ item.tagline }}</h3>
              <p class="mt-3 text-[14px] leading-relaxed text-[#6B7280]">{{ item.description }}</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          {# Divider + bordered pill CTA, pinned to the card bottom #}
          <div class="mt-7 border-t border-navy-100 pt-6">
            <span class="relative z-10 inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-md border border-navy-200 px-4 py-2 font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-wide text-navy-900 transition-colors duration-200 group-hover:border-navy-400 group-hover:bg-navy-50">
              {{ item.cta | default('View product') }}
              <svg class="h-3 w-3 transition-transform duration-200 group-hover:translate-x-1" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M17 8l4 4m0 0l-4 4m4-4H3"/>
              </svg>
            </span>
          </div>

          <a href="{{ item.url }}" class="absolute inset-0 z-0" aria-label="{{ item.title }} — {{ item.cta | default('View product') }}"></a>
        </article>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{# =====================================================
   PLATFORM TIE-IN — same dark navy card used to close out every
   product-v2.njk / product-app.njk page, ties the catalog back
   into the shared platform layer instead of leaving products
   looking like six unrelated tools.
   ===================================================== #}
{# Platform orbit — two concentric rings of product icons continuously
   orbiting the platform hub (MagicUI "OrbitingCircles" composition —
   outer + inner ring, opposite directions — rebuilt in plain CSS
   custom properties, our own tokens). Angle is the starting position
   in degrees (-90 = 12 o'clock), evenly spaced 120deg apart per ring. #}
{% set outerOrbitNodes = [
  { icon: "search",   angle: -90, title: "Zunkiree Search", url: "/products/search/" },
  { icon: "users",    angle: 30,  title: "AI CRM", url: "/products/ai-crm/" },
  { icon: "chart",    angle: 150, title: "Gaamma", url: "/products/gaamma/" }
] %}
{% set innerOrbitNodes = [
  { icon: "cart",     angle: -30, title: "Stella", url: "/products/ai-commerce-agent/" },
  { icon: "calendar", angle: 90,  title: "Zenly", url: "/products/ai-booking-engine/" },
  { icon: "dental",   angle: 210, title: "Dental AI Assistant", url: "/products/dental-ai/" }
] %}
<section class="px-4 pb-12 pt-4 sm:px-6 sm:pb-16 lg:px-8" aria-labelledby="products-platform-heading">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-5xl">
    <div
      class="relative overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-navy-100 bg-gradient-to-br from-sky-50/70 via-white to-white"
      data-reveal
    >
      <div
        class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 z-0"
        aria-hidden="true"
        style="background: radial-gradient(ellipse 55% 70% at 100% 0%, rgba(118,185,0,0.10) 0%, transparent 60%);"
      ></div>

      <div class="relative z-10 grid grid-cols-1 items-center gap-2 lg:grid-cols-2">
        {# Left — copy, unchanged from before #}
        <div class="p-8 sm:p-10 lg:p-12">
          <span class="mb-3 block font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-wider text-sky-600">Platform</span>
          <h2 id="products-platform-heading" class="max-w-xl text-[24px] font-medium leading-[1.2] text-[#111827] sm:text-[28px]">
            Every product runs on the same shared platform layer
          </h2>
          <p class="mt-3 max-w-xl text-[14px] leading-relaxed text-[#6B7280]">
            One multi-tenant CRM, Zunkiree Search, and Orca orchestration sit underneath every product on this page — so integrations, data, and workflows stay connected instead of living in six separate silos.
          </p>
          <a
            href="/#platform"
            class="mt-7 inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-md border border-navy-200 px-5 py-2.5 font-mono text-[12px] uppercase tracking-wide text-navy-900 transition-colors duration-200 hover:border-navy-400 hover:bg-navy-50 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-[#76B900] focus-visible:ring-offset-2"
          >
            Explore the platform
            <span class="h-1.5 w-1.5 flex-shrink-0 rounded-full bg-[#76B900]" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          </a>
        </div>

        {# Right — orbiting-circles diagram: the six product icons continuously
           orbit the platform hub on two concentric rings (MagicUI-style
           composition), illustrating "every product runs on the platform"
           rather than decorating it. Each node is a real link to its
           product page; the name label only appears on hover/focus so the
           diagram stays quiet by default. #}
        <div class="flex items-center justify-center p-8 sm:p-10 lg:p-12 lg:pl-0">
          <div class="products-orbit relative aspect-square w-full max-w-[360px]">
            {# Static orbit paths — outer + inner #}
            <svg viewBox="0 0 360 360" class="absolute inset-0 h-full w-full" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
              <circle cx="180" cy="180" r="132" stroke="#3d8fd4" stroke-width="1" stroke-dasharray="3 4" stroke-opacity="0.4"/>
              <circle cx="180" cy="180" r="72" stroke="#3d8fd4" stroke-width="1" stroke-dasharray="3 4" stroke-opacity="0.3"/>
            </svg>

            {# Center hub — stationary, sky blue so it reads as a distinct
               "platform" core rather than a seventh product node #}
            <div class="absolute left-1/2 top-1/2 flex h-14 w-14 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 items-center justify-center" aria-hidden="true">
              <span class="absolute inline-flex h-full w-full animate-ping rounded-full bg-sky-400/30"></span>
              <span class="relative flex h-14 w-14 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-sky-200/60 bg-[#3d8fd4] shadow-card">
                <svg class="h-6 w-6 text-white" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                  <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3"/>
                  <path d="M12 2v4M12 18v4M4.9 4.9l2.8 2.8M16.3 16.3l2.8 2.8M2 12h4M18 12h4M4.9 19.1l2.8-2.8M16.3 7.7l2.8-2.8"/>
                </svg>
              </span>
            </div>

            {# Outer ring — larger icons, slower, clockwise #}
            {% for node in outerOrbitNodes %}
            <a
              href="{{ node.url }}"
              aria-label="{{ node.title }}"
              class="orbit-node group/node absolute flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-navy-900 bg-navy-950 text-[#76B900] shadow-card"
              style="top: 50%; left: 50%; margin-top: -24px; margin-left: -24px; --orbit-angle: {{ node.angle }}deg; --orbit-radius: 132px; --orbit-duration: 30s; --orbit-direction: 1;"
            >
              {% set iconName = node.icon %}
              {% include "components/nav-icon.njk" %}
              <span class="pointer-events-none absolute -top-11 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 whitespace-nowrap rounded-md bg-navy-950 px-2.5 py-1 font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-wide text-white opacity-0 shadow-card transition-opacity duration-200 group-hover/node:opacity-100 group-focus-visible/node:opacity-100" aria-hidden="true">
                {{ node.title }}
              </span>
            </a>
            {% endfor %}

            {# Inner ring — smaller icons, faster, counter-clockwise #}
            {% for node in innerOrbitNodes %}
            <a
              href="{{ node.url }}"
              aria-label="{{ node.title }}"
              class="orbit-node group/node absolute flex h-9 w-9 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-navy-900 bg-navy-950 text-[#76B900] shadow-card"
              style="top: 50%; left: 50%; margin-top: -18px; margin-left: -18px; --orbit-angle: {{ node.angle }}deg; --orbit-radius: 72px; --orbit-duration: 17s; --orbit-direction: -1;"
            >
              {% set iconName = node.icon %}
              {% include "components/nav-icon.njk" %}
              <span class="pointer-events-none absolute -top-10 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 whitespace-nowrap rounded-md bg-navy-950 px-2.5 py-1 font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-wide text-white opacity-0 shadow-card transition-opacity duration-200 group-hover/node:opacity-100 group-focus-visible/node:opacity-100" aria-hidden="true">
                {{ node.title }}
              </span>
            </a>
            {% endfor %}
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .orbit-node {
    animation-name: products-orbit;
    animation-timing-function: linear;
    animation-iteration-count: infinite;
    animation-duration: var(--orbit-duration, 24s);
  }
  @keyframes products-orbit {
    from {
      transform: rotate(calc(var(--orbit-angle) * var(--orbit-direction, 1)))
                 translateX(var(--orbit-radius))
                 rotate(calc(var(--orbit-angle) * var(--orbit-direction, 1) * -1));
    }
    to {
      transform: rotate(calc(var(--orbit-angle) * var(--orbit-direction, 1) + (360deg * var(--orbit-direction, 1))))
                 translateX(var(--orbit-radius))
                 rotate(calc((var(--orbit-angle) * var(--orbit-direction, 1) + (360deg * var(--orbit-direction, 1))) * -1));
    }
  }
  .orbit-node:hover,
  .orbit-node:focus-visible {
    animation-play-state: paused;
    z-index: 20;
  }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .orbit-node { animation: none; transform: rotate(var(--orbit-angle)) translateX(var(--orbit-radius)) rotate(calc(var(--orbit-angle) * -1)); }
  }
</style>

{# =====================================================
   CLOSING DUAL CTA — same shell as product-app.njk / industry.njk,
   both CTAs (product demo + browse services) preserved from the
